        "original_id": "68bd9788-a050-508e-8a94-847a0c80fff5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: How Glory Goes\n- People: Audra McDonald, Harold Arlen, Adam Guettel, Elena Shaddow, Katie Clarke\n- Works: The Light in the Piazza\n- Roles: Clara Johnson\n\nFacts:\n- Adam Guettel was born on December 16, 1964, and is an American composer-lyricist of musical theater and opera.\n- Audra McDonald's album How Glory Goes was released in 2000 as her second album.\n- Five songs on How Glory Goes were written by Harold Arlen.\n- Two songs on How Glory Goes were written by Adam Guettel, including the title track.\n- Elena Shaddow toured as Clara Johnson in Adam Guettel's The Light in the Piazza before leaving the production and being replaced by Katie Clarke.",
